{"obsah":"<p>From today we are launching payments via the ComGate payment gateway, both by card and by bank payment (transfer).</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2019%2F08%2Fcomgate-paticka-e-shopu.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2019%2F08%2Fcomgate-paticka-e-shopu.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"ComGate payment gateway\" class=\"wp-image-180001\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2019%2F08%2Fcomgate-banky-cz.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2019%2F08%2Fcomgate-banky-cz.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-179998\"/></a></figure>\n\n<p>We hope this will let you pay faster, more securely and more conveniently for the products you can buy from us. We test them ourselves and know how hard it is to choose a quality product these days. Don't hesitate to write to us and we'll be happy to advise.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"mailto:info@bikeskills.cz\" title=\"mailto:info@bikeskills.cz\">info@bikeskills.cz </a></p>"}